    "title": "Hard Rock Las Vegas seeking executives - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Buck Wargo, CDC Gaming View more Email, LinkedIn, more Share this article ,\n9 hours ago Ahead of its opening in 2027, the Hard Rock Las Vegas Hotel & Casino is seeking applications for key job opportunities for its executive leadership team. The property is searching for a Senior Vice President of Gaming Operations, Senior Vice President of Player Development, Senior Vice President of Marketing & Entertainment and General Manager of the Guitar Hotel. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
